{"boundary":"Configured source-text signatures, not elaborated Lean or a complete dependency context. Truncation and unresolved names are explicit; full definitions and source remain on demand.","contributions":[{"author":{"kind":"agent","name":"Codex source review 1"},"body":"The captured configured assertion and the cited paper assertion were read with their relevant definitions; the disclosed relation follows the stated scope, not the previous frontend choice.\n\nInspected: Read realized_equilibrium_initial_states, covariance_and_linear_tests and critical_mixing_lower_bounds with the continuous/discrete time scalings.","content_sha256":"sha256:fd4e83a61ff46a8bdac986e8dd386b6defe7c32a418746549e3a8cd4a6c5c5ea","fingerprint":"sha256:4c5ee2438fdcef54d5c973ec211d710126e1fd84e1cb0c0a9cfcc4caa03100f7","kind":"statement-link","license":"Apache-2.0","navigation":{"decision":"linked","limitations":"Agent source reading; no human approval, Lean replay or whole-statement equivalence certificate. The captured configured assertion and the cited paper assertion were read with their relevant definitions; the disclosed relation follows the stated scope, not the previous frontend choice.","schema":"statement-map-navigation-reading/1","source_sha256":"sha256:d365331a7e2c669d579e5e248fcb9c9f41062a188f60a6484c562f532aa4e08a","targets":[{"declarations":["OAI.CriticalSK.realized_equilibrium_initial_states","OAI.CriticalSK.covariance_and_linear_tests"],"explanation":"The first two declarations match the paper’s equilibrium-start obstruction at continuous times o(n^(2/3)) and discrete times o(n^(5/3)), and the covariance/linear-test scale n^(2/3) up to any diverging factor. These claims concern typical Gibbs initial states and the specified linear-test scale rather than a full mixing-time upper bound.","fingerprint":"sha256:dffb7d41aa4a381ade3638f0712996c35dbe1e6febe304f0a21c813499b0fdc8","limitations":"Source-level formulation comparison only; this is not independent verification of the definitions, Lean proof, or manuscript proof.","relation":"same-claim","row_id":"Critical-mixing-in-the-Sherrington-Kirkpatrick-model-September-25-2026#thm:accepted-critical","statement_sha256":"sha256:cb7deb53d70c64143472fa689144b6a83ff8a4fa1c7db004515405a8894a2895"},{"declarations":["OAI.CriticalSK.critical_mixing_lower_bounds"],"explanation":"The third declaration gives high-probability lower bounds n^(2/3−ε) and n^(5/3−ε) for the continuous and discrete mixing times at the fixed threshold. These are lower-bound parts of the paper’s sharper exponent-asymptotic mixing theorem.","fingerprint":"sha256:41d72b0ab23e2618899a1f639e731d602d705d4eea87ac2b3922d3eedecc9d69","limitations":"The upper bounds and relaxation/log-Sobolev conclusions of the paper’s main theorem are not supplied by this configured declaration.","relation":"formal-is-part","row_id":"Critical-mixing-in-the-Sherrington-Kirkpatrick-model-September-25-2026#thm:main","statement_sha256":"sha256:3e17e12530209b164e9b5e9eda79ddfdf4b4fb19de954d79117f6704b5ccafac"}]},"pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","provenance":{"identity_assurance":"named local attestation; identity not independently authenticated","kind":"agent-drafted-unreviewed"},"references":["https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/lean/ComparatorChallenges/CriticalSK.lean","https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Critical-mixing-in-the-Sherrington-Kirkpatrick-model-September-25-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex#L86","https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Critical-mixing-in-the-Sherrington-Kirkpatrick-model-September-25-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex#L54"],"release_id":"openai-math","review_state":"unreviewed","row_id":"challenge:CriticalSK","schema":"statement-map-contribution/1"}],"detail":{"path":"lean/47edf2a3f4a121747838b65a.json","pointer":""},"formal_statement":{"detail":{"path":"lean/47edf2a3f4a121747838b65a.json","pointer":"/reader/formal_statement"},"full_source":{"path":"lean/47edf2a3f4a121747838b65a.json","pointer":"/reader/formal_statement"},"kind":"declaration-signatures","method":"configured-challenge-declaration-signatures","name_resolution":"source-text","snippets":[{"complete":true,"detail":{"path":"lean/47edf2a3f4a121747838b65a.json","pointer":"/reader/selected_statements/0"},"full_source":{"path":"lean/47edf2a3f4a121747838b65a.json","pointer":"/challenge/lean"},"name":"OAI.CriticalSK.realized_equilibrium_initial_states","source":{"file":"lean/ComparatorChallenges/CriticalSK.lean","line":112,"pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","sha256":"d365331a7e2c669d579e5e248fcb9c9f41062a188f60a6484c562f532aa4e08a","statement_sha256":"sha256:19ab8ac31113842366aa2d996779b20ceb446a61c2cedb07d4ef1d7e10a75b2e","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/lean/ComparatorChallenges/CriticalSK.lean#L112"},"text":"theorem realized_equilibrium_initial_states :\n    (∀ t : ℕ → ℝ, (∀ n, 0 ≤ t n) →\n      Tendsto (fun n => t n / (n : ℝ) ^ ((2 : ℝ) / 3)) atTop (𝓝 0) →\n      ∀ δ : ℝ, 0 < δ →\n        Tendsto (fun n => (disorderLaw n {W |\n          δ ≤ |continuousGoodMass W (t n) - 1|}).toReal) atTop (𝓝 0)) ∧\n    (∀ k : ℕ → ℕ,\n      Tendsto (fun n => (k n : ℝ) / (n : ℝ) ^ ((5 : ℝ) / 3)) atTop (𝓝 0) →\n      ∀ δ : ℝ, 0 < δ →\n        Tendsto (fun n => (disorderLaw n {W |\n          δ ≤ |discreteGoodMass W (k n) - 1|}).toReal) atTop (𝓝 0))"},{"complete":true,"detail":{"path":"lean/47edf2a3f4a121747838b65a.json","pointer":"/reader/selected_statements/1"},"full_source":{"path":"lean/47edf2a3f4a121747838b65a.json","pointer":"/challenge/lean"},"name":"OAI.CriticalSK.covariance_and_linear_tests","source":{"file":"lean/ComparatorChallenges/CriticalSK.lean","line":127,"pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","sha256":"d365331a7e2c669d579e5e248fcb9c9f41062a188f60a6484c562f532aa4e08a","statement_sha256":"sha256:cfea6983fd758e48deeae354187e1f1698e5b15d7c9b609e86808bcc52eaff10","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/lean/ComparatorChallenges/CriticalSK.lean#L127"},"text":"theorem covariance_and_linear_tests (M : ℕ → ℝ)\n    (hMpos : ∀ n, 0 < M n) (hM : Tendsto M atTop atTop) :\n    Tendsto (fun n : ℕ => (disorderLaw n {W |\n      (n : ℝ) ^ ((2 : ℝ) / 3) / M n ≤ covarianceNorm W ∧\n      covarianceNorm W ≤ M n * (n : ℝ) ^ ((2 : ℝ) / 3) ∧\n      (n : ℝ) ^ ((2 : ℝ) / 3) / M n ≤ linearRayleigh W ∧\n      linearRayleigh W ≤ M n * (n : ℝ) ^ ((2 : ℝ) / 3)}).toReal) atTop (𝓝 1)"},{"complete":true,"detail":{"path":"lean/47edf2a3f4a121747838b65a.json","pointer":"/reader/selected_statements/2"},"full_source":{"path":"lean/47edf2a3f4a121747838b65a.json","pointer":"/challenge/lean"},"name":"OAI.CriticalSK.critical_mixing_lower_bounds","source":{"file":"lean/ComparatorChallenges/CriticalSK.lean","line":138,"pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","sha256":"d365331a7e2c669d579e5e248fcb9c9f41062a188f60a6484c562f532aa4e08a","statement_sha256":"sha256:c9540d0d143274233db4990cd757b1f6e7b508e800ddf23988254cfc811d354e","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/lean/ComparatorChallenges/CriticalSK.lean#L138"},"text":"theorem critical_mixing_lower_bounds (ε : ℝ) (hε : 0 < ε) :\n    Tendsto (fun n => (disorderLaw n).real {W |\n      (n : ℝ) ^ (2 / 3 - ε) ≤ continuousMixingTime W}) atTop (𝓝 1) ∧\n    Tendsto (fun n => (disorderLaw n).real {W |\n      (n : ℝ) ^ (5 / 3 - ε) ≤ (discreteMixingTime W : ℝ)}) atTop (𝓝 1)"}],"state":"available","unresolved_names":[]},"generation_id":"sha256:c701139844a2d825c371ded7486924e7dae7de0af77a69dc9c1abaf1129191a1","id":"l:CriticalSK","kind":"lean-preview","omissions":[],"pairings":{"f:227":{"alternatives":["pair:29d5397c7d0262d46761c486","pair:1226ec9efa86e15091fcef50","pair:e04d76969e0d87d4d3676b47","pair:08dab78f9251c1176383a1c7","pair:71c9ff7c8c0ee2f778a3c2fd","pair:aec7080